// The private half: the same name and the same signature, a different answer.
//
// The signatures agree on purpose. A third module bound to this one instead of
// `gauge` still type-checks and still compiles, so the only thing that shows
// the mistake is the number that comes back.

/// Three times what this module's own reading says.
snug_use() -> int => fits("ab")

fits(s: str) -> int => s.length() * 3
